From: rime-fork <rime-fork@localhost>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 08:47:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Long press a digit or punctuation key for its Shift symbol
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

sable/PenglaiLongPress.swift: in Penglai Zhuyin the number row and , . / ; - are zhuyin or tones; holding one until it auto-repeats types the key's Shift symbol instead (。 ？ ： ！ ...), as Shift+key would, with the schema's punctuation menus. The key's own press goes to librime as before; on its first auto-repeat, if the input is still just that key added, put back the input from before it (digit keys commit the composition first, since Shift+digit selects a candidate) and send the Shift symbol. Later repeats are dropped. Setting: long_press_symbols in sable.yaml (on unless false). This adds the file to the Xcode project and hooks it into the input controller.
---
 Squirrel.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj    |  4 +++
 sources/SquirrelInputController.swift | 48 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 52 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Squirrel.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj b/Squirrel.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
index 8def729..b088356 100644
--- a/Squirrel.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
+++ b/Squirrel.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
@@ -104,6 +104,7 @@
 		B3F0A00C2F26020000AA0001 /* PenglaiAXDiag.swift in Sources */ = {isa = PBXBuildFile; fileRef = B3F0A00B2F26020000AA0001 /* PenglaiAXDiag.swift */; };
 		B3F0A00E2F26020000AA0001 /* PenglaiInstall.swift in Sources */ = {isa = PBXBuildFile; fileRef = B3F0A00D2F26020000AA0001 /* PenglaiInstall.swift */; };
 		B3F0A0102F26020000AA0001 /* PenglaiDictionary.swift in Sources */ = {isa = PBXBuildFile; fileRef = B3F0A00F2F26020000AA0001 /* PenglaiDictionary.swift */; };
+		B3F0A0122F26020000AA0001 /* PenglaiLongPress.swift in Sources */ = {isa = PBXBuildFile; fileRef = B3F0A0112F26020000AA0001 /* PenglaiLongPress.swift */; };
 /* End PBXBuildFile section */
 
